      "mergeID": "65fbb4591cc317afed904c44",
      "mergedPostDetails": "The current version of YTDL that VRChat is using has an issue when fetching the video links from youtube, as youtube likely changed parts of their API recently, which YTDL has already pushed fixes for.\n\nI did a test with a version that was a couple months old and part of the APIs YTDL checks for video links were failing with 400 bad request.\n\nBottom 2 images attached you can see the lack of the typical 720p link from ytdl and it being present after updating via the yt-dlp -U command.\n\nThe top image was running the same --list-formats command but with vrchat's exact YTDL copy instead of my own.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Youtube DL needs updated",
